ction","name":"home_status","description":"查武陵居家裡的感測值與設備狀態（溫度、濕度、二氧化碳、PM2.5、設備在不在線等），由家裡的中控回報。這個工具只查詢；要開關或調整家電用 home_control。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"target":{"type":"string","description":"房間、設備名稱或「全家」，照使用者的說法填（例如「客廳」「客廳主燈」「全家」）"},"metric":{"type":"string","description":"要查的讀值，可省略","enum":["temperature","humidity","co2","pm25","pm10","voc","formaldehyde","illuminance","battery","power_usage","energy","presence","motion","leak","contact"]}},"required":["target"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"type":"function","name":"home_control","description":"控制武陵居家裡的一台設備：開關、亮度、燈的色溫、顏色、音量、靜音、播放／暫停／停止、窗簾；AIFA 冷氣的開關、設定溫度（ac_temperature）、模式、風量、擺風；紅外線家電（電視、電風扇等）按一個遙控鍵（press）。由家裡的中控執行，回傳真實結果：燈、插座等會回讀確認；冷氣與紅外線家電沒有回讀，最多只會「已送出」，不會確認。一次只控制一台；整個房間或全家一起控制還不支援。不是 AIFA 的冷氣（Tuya、Home Assistant）與無線按鈕還不能用語音控制。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"target":{"type":"string","description":"一台設備的名稱，照使用者的說法填（例如「客廳主燈」「書桌燈」「冷氣」「電視」）；度數、按鍵不要放在這裡"},"command":{"type":"string","description":"power 開關；brightness 亮度；color_temperature 燈的色溫（K，不是冷氣溫度）；color 顏色；volume 音量數字（紅外線家電不能用）；mute 靜音；play／pause／stop 播放控制；cover 窗簾；ac_temperature AIFA 冷氣的設定溫度（攝氏）；ac_mode 冷氣模式；ac_fan 冷氣風量；ac_swing 冷氣擺風；press 紅外線家電按一個遙控鍵","enum":["power","brightness","color_temperature","color","volume","mute","play","pause","stop","cover","ac_temperature","ac_mode","ac_fan","ac_swing","press"]},"value":{"type":"string","description":"power／mute：true 或 false；brightness／volume：0 到 100；color_temperature：2500 到 9000；color：#RRGGBB；cover：open、close 或 stop；ac_temperature：攝氏整數，例如 26（通常 17 到 30）；ac_mode：auto、cool 或 dry；ac_fan：auto、low、medium、high、up（調大一格）或 down（調小一格）；ac_swing：auto 或 fixed_1 到 fixed_5；press：power、volume_up、volume_down、mute、channel_up、channel_down、fan_speed、oscillate，或使用者說的按鍵名稱；play／pause／stop 不用填"}},"required":["target","command"],"additionalProperties":false}}]"`;

